      deck: 'Typically 8 standard decks (~416 cards) shuffled together.',
      equipment: 'Typically 8 standard decks (~416 cards) shuffled together.',
      dealing: 'Dealer shuffles 6–8 standard decks; two cards each to Player and Banker (and optional side bets).',
